^{:go/end 727} (go/func FileInfoHeader "FileInfoHeader creates a partially-populated [Header] from fi.\nIf fi describes a symlink, FileInfoHeader records link as the link target.\nIf fi describes a directory, a slash is appended to the name.\n\nSince fs.FileInfo's Name method only returns the base name of\nthe file it describes, it may be necessary to modify Header.Name\nto provide the full path name of the file.\n\nIf fi implements [FileInfoNames]\nHeader.Gname and Header.Uname\nare provided by the methods of the interface.\n" [^fs/FileInfo fi ^string link] :results [(* Header) error]
